{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"5":{"eng-name":"Establishing the Prayer and the Sunnah Regarding Them","ara-name":"كتاب إقامة الصلاة والسنة فيها"}},"section_detail":{"5":{"hadithnumber_first":803,"hadithnumber_last":1432,"arabicnumber_first":803,"arabicnumber_last":1432}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":975,"arabicnumber":975,"text":"Rapporté par Anas : Le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ) a dirigé la prière pour une femme de sa famille et moi-même. Je me suis mis à sa droite et la femme s’est placée derrière nous","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim"}],"reference":{"book":5,"hadith":173},"chapter":{"id":44,"ara-name":"باب الاِثْنَانِ جَمَاعَةٌ","eng-name":"Two are a congregation","isFirstHadith":false}}]}